---
title: Ham, brie and fig baguette
servings: 1
tags: [pork, quick]
source: Ham, Brie, and Fig Preserve Grilled Cheese by Bonne Maman, https://bonnemaman.us/blogs/recipe/ham-brie-and-fig-preserve-grilled-cheese
---

Split the @baguette{1/2%loaf} lengthwise and warm it in a #toaster oven{} until
crisp. Build the sandwich straight away, while the bread is hot.

Layer the @ham{1%oz}(sliced) on the bottom half, then the
@brie cheese{1%oz}(or another soft cheese), then the @arugula{1/2%oz}.

Spread the @fig preserves{1-1.5%tbsp} on the top half, close, and eat warm.
